@startuml
title SSAD — Dependency-Driven Analysis Workflow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle DISCOVER
rectangle BOUND
rectangle OWN
rectangle MODEL
rectangle CONNECT
rectangle SYNTHESIZE
rectangle VERIFY
rectangle STABILIZE
rectangle EVOLVE
rectangle "CHANGE ANALYSIS" as CHANGE

DISCOVER --> BOUND
BOUND --> OWN
OWN --> MODEL
MODEL --> CONNECT
CONNECT --> SYNTHESIZE
SYNTHESIZE --> VERIFY
VERIFY --> STABILIZE
STABILIZE --> EVOLVE
EVOLVE --> CHANGE

VERIFY ..> OWN : contradiction may reopen ownership
VERIFY ..> MODEL : evidence may reopen model
CHANGE ..> BOUND : boundary-changing change
CHANGE ..> OWN : ownership-changing change

note bottom
Stages express knowledge dependency,
not waterfall phases.
end note
@enduml
